    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.123 SLES-15-030340"
      info        : "The SUSE operating system must generate audit records for all uses of the chfn command.

GROUP ID: V-234933
RULE ID: SV-234933r958412

Reconstruction of harmful events or forensic analysis is not possible if audit records do not contain enough information.

